sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Workload controller
    participant A as Kubernetes API
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant C as EBS CSI
    participant E as Amazon EBS
    participant K as Kubelet

    U->>A: Create PVC and Pod
    S->>A: Choose node and AZ
    C->>A: Observe selected topology
    C->>E: Create encrypted GP3 volume
    E-->>C: Volume available in selected AZ
    C->>E: Attach volume to node
    K->>K: Format and mount
    K-->>A: Pod running
